# @file Silence Suzuka - Affection
# @author 牛蛙煲
# @author Katze (translator)
49:
  title: A Peculiar Hug?
  lines:
    - One day, %YOU% stood by the railing of the training track timing Suzuka's long-distance run.
    - As Suzuka sped past %YOU% on her penultimate lap, %YOU% glanced down at the stopwatch and couldn't help letting out an appreciative whistle.
    - By all accounts, Suzuka was in peak form; even in the final laps, her stride showed no sign of flagging.
    - Watching Suzuka round the far bend, %YOU% tossed the stopwatch lightly into the air and caught it.
    - It seemed today's training regimen would wrap up well ahead of schedule.
    - Before long, Suzuka swept through the final curve, sprinting all-out toward the finish line where %YOU% waited.
    - Checking the timer once more, %YOU% gave her an enthusiastic thumbs-up.
    - Seeing %YOU%'s affirming gesture, a wave of delight washed over Suzuka.
    - %SEX% crossed the line in a flash and jogged cheerfully toward %YOU%.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「%CALLNAME%, how was my time—」
    - Her voice cut off mid-sentence. Swept up in excitement, Suzuka failed to notice a rut in the grass and caught her foot.
    - Determined not to let celebration turn into disaster, %YOU% lunged forward instinctively to catch her.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Ah!」
    - Without question, %YOU% overshot the mark. %YOU% had meant to catch Suzuka by the hands, but taking half a step too many, %YOU%'s arms wrapped right around her waist.
    - %YOU% instinctively tightened the embrace.
    - At the exact same moment, Suzuka's flailing arms found a landing spot—winding tightly around %YOU%'s waist in turn.
    - To any bystander walking past, %YOU% and Suzuka looked for all the world like two lovers locked in a passionate embrace.
    - Soft and warm as Suzuka felt in %YOU%'s arms, temptingly hard to let go, %YOU% soon realized how compromising the position was and awkwardly tried to disengage.
    - But Suzuka seemed completely oblivious, only tightening her arms around %YOU% even further.
    - Gazing down at the trainee %UMA% burying her face into %YOU%'s chest, %YOU% didn't know whether to laugh or cry.
    - acc: 1
      content: 「Could you let go now? If you keep holding me like this, Suzuka, people are going to get the wrong idea.」
    - Only then did Suzuka reluctantly release %YOU%.
    - Breathing a sigh of relief, %YOU% hoped both of you could put this awkward blunder behind you as quickly as possible.
    - %YOU% pulled out a towel and a water bottle to hand over, only to find she was already sprinting away with hands cupped over her bright red face.
    - acc: 1
      content: 「Hey, Suzuka! Your towel!」
    - %YOU% took a couple of steps in pursuit with the towel in hand. Her sweet scent still lingered in the air, but her silhouette had already vanished from sight.
    - Well, today's training goals were thoroughly met anyway, so the rest of the day was hers to enjoy...
    - With that thought, %YOU% turned away with a wry smile.
    - divider: true
      content: Evening, Dormitory
      position: left
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「No, that's not right... That feels wrong too...」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: Sharing the room with %CHARA%, %S_NAME% watched in utter bewilderment as %CHARA% flushed crimson and awkwardly tried hugging herself over and over.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: %SEX% reached out a hand multiple times to ask what was the matter, but timidly pulled it back each time.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: Still, after watching %CHARA% lost in a lovestruck daze for nearly an hour, %SEX% finally worked up the nerve to speak.
    - color: %S_COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %S_NAME%
        - 「Um, %1_CALL%? Did... something happen?」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: %CHARA% froze instantly on the spot and looked back at %S_NAME%, prompting the latter to poke out her tongue and shrink back sheepishly.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「%CALL_1%, could you come over and do me a favor?」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: To %S_NAME%'s surprise, %CHARA% asked for her help.
    - color: %S_COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %S_NAME%
        - 「Of course, anything for you, %1_CALL%! But... are you sure you need my help?」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: %CHARA% nodded solemnly.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Um, %CALL_1%... would you mind hugging me for a second...?」
    - color: %S_COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %S_NAME%
        - 「Sure! ...Wait, whaaat?!」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: %S_NAME% agreed on instinct, only to double take in shock a second later.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: %CHARA%'s cheeks burned red, but %SEX% kept her gaze locked on %S_NAME% and nodded firmly.
    - color: %S_COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %S_NAME%
        - 「Isn't this a little weird, %1_CALL%...? Whoa?!」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: Before %S_NAME% could finish backing out, %CHARA% stepped forward and wrapped her arms around her.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: The sudden tackle startled %S_NAME% so much she nearly jumped out of her skin.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Come on, hold me tight, %CALL_1%.」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: Burying her face into %S_NAME%'s shoulder, %SEX% squeezed a little harder.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: Seeing that there was no breaking free, %S_NAME% timidly brought her arms up to return the embrace.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Could you hold me tighter?」
    - color: %S_COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %S_NAME%
        - 「O-Okay!」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Still not quite tight enough...」
    - color: %S_COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %S_NAME%
        - 「I-I'll squeeze tighter!」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: '............'
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: '........'
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: '....'
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: %CHARA% and %S_NAME% stood locked in each other's arms in the dorm room for a long time—one unsatisfied, the other stiff as a board.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Thank you, %CALL_1%. You can let go now.」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: %CHARA% furrowed her brow slightly, watching %S_NAME% step back with a massive sigh of relief.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「It's still completely different from the way %CALLNAME% held me...」
    - color: %S_COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %S_NAME%
        - 「Eeeh?!」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: Just as %S_NAME% thought she could finally catch her breath, overhearing %CHARA%'s wistful murmur gave her another heart attack.

74:
  title: Heart to Heart
  lines:
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「I love having an open, empty track ahead of me.」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Just me, running quietly at the very front...」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「That feeling is pure bliss. Once you experience it, you never want to let anyone take it away.」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「I ought to keep looking straight ahead, yet recently... I feel this overwhelming urge to turn around and look back...」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Is it because of %CALLNAME%...? Always looking after me so tenderly, worrying about me, designing training plans just for me, letting me see vistas far more beautiful than ever before...」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「I want to run right beside you... to take the open sky that once belonged to me alone, and gently place it in your hands...」
    - divider: true
    - Checking the phone after a long day of work, %YOU% saw that Suzuka had sent a message a few hours earlier.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「%CALLNAME%, are you free this evening? I was hoping we could go for a walk together.」
    - %YOU% scratched your head, slightly taken aback by her uncharacteristic invitation. But realizing %YOU% had left her waiting for hours, %YOU% quickly decided to agree.
    - acc: 1
      content: 「Sure, I'll head over to your dorm to meet you right now.」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Okay!」
    - Suzuka replied within seconds, punctuating her message with an adorable excited %UMA% sticker.
    - Setting the phone down on the desk, %YOU% leaned back into the chair and stretched lazily.
    - Suzuka seemed genuinely eager for this evening stroll, and surprisingly, %YOU% found %YOU%'s own curiosity piqued as well.
    - Before long, %YOU% arrived outside Suzuka's dormitory.
    - There stood Suzuka in understated casual wear, waiting patiently in the cool evening breeze, looking as though she had been standing there for quite some time.
    - Catching sight of %YOU% in the distance, her eyes lit up, and she hurried forward to meet %YOU%.
    - acc: 1
      content: 「Sorry about that, Suzuka. Am I late...?」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Not at all, %CALLNAME%! I just stepped outside myself.」
    - Without letting %YOU% finish, she offered a sweet, shameless little fib.
    - Closing the distance naturally, she looped her arm through %YOU%'s with practiced familiarity.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Let's go, %CALLNAME%!」
    - And so, Suzuka led %YOU% away by the arm.
    - Strolling hand in hand along a quiet riverbank near the academy, the two of you chatted leisurely about racing and life at Tracen.
    - No matter what topic %YOU% brought up, Suzuka would smile softly and agree with every single word.
    - The effortless warmth felt so comforting that time slipped past unnoticed, right until a bright moon hung high above the water.
    - Glancing down at the time, %YOU% nearly jumped.
    - acc: 1
      content: 「Suzuka, it's gotten really late. We should probably head back.」
    - A little flustered, %YOU% prepared to turn back toward campus with her.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「No, %CALLNAME%.」
    - %YOU% turned around in surprise; this was the very first time all evening she had pushed back against %YOU%'s suggestion.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「%CALLNAME%... could you stay and talk with me a little longer? There are things I truly want to tell you...」
    - A sudden flush rose to her cheeks, and she turned her gaze away, unable to meet %YOU%'s eyes.
    - Looking at her, then back down at the late hour, %YOU% weighed the choice carefully before answering.
    - acc: 1
      key: update
      content: 「Then let's keep walking.」 (Deepen Relationship)
      lines:
        - Hearing %YOU%'s affirmative response, Suzuka's demeanor instantly blossomed with excitement.
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: %CHARA%
            - 「Um, %CALLNAME%... lately whenever I run, I keep feeling this irresistible urge to look behind me.」
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: %CHARA%
            - 「Even when I know I should keep my eyes straight ahead, chasing after the horizon, I just can't stop myself from looking back...」
        - acc: 1
          content: 「Behind you...? But that's just where I'm standing. What's so interesting about me?」
        - %YOU% teased her half-jokingly, watching her blush deepen by the second.
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: %CHARA%
            - 「Why would it be %CALLNAME%?! What I want to look back at is the starting gate! I...」
        - Blurting out an instinctive denial, Suzuka immediately realized her slip of the tongue.
        - Not only had she cut off her own retreat, she had painted herself into an even tighter corner.
        - Watching her cheeks burn brighter than ever, %YOU% couldn't resist teasing her a little more.
        - acc: 1
          content: 「So you're saying Miss Suzuka has a profound love for starting gates?」
        - Suzuka gave %YOU%'s waist a firm swat that hit with the startling momentum of a runaway compact car.
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: %CHARA%
            - 「It's not the starting gate! This has nothing to do with starting gates! %CALLNAME%, you're so mean...」
        - divider: true
        - Unfortunately, %YOU%'s teasing ended up draining the last ounce of courage Suzuka had gathered. All the way back to the academy gates, she kept her head down, completely silent.
        - acc: 1
          content: 「Well then, Suzuka, see you tomorrow?」
        - Seeing that you had arrived outside the gates, %YOU% felt the fatigue catching up and prepared to bid her goodnight.
        - Seeing %YOU% about to leave, the hesitating girl finally mustered her courage one more time.
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: %CHARA%
            - 「No, %CALLNAME%... you can't go just yet...」
        - Seeing %YOU% pause in mild bewilderment, Suzuka drew in a long, deep breath to steady her trembling voice.
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: %CHARA%
            - 「I kept wondering... why do I always want to turn around?」
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: %CHARA%
            - 「And then it finally hit me... It's because you're standing right there...」
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: %CHARA%
            - 「Before I even realized it, my eyes weren't just searching for the open road anymore. They were searching for you—your gentle smiles, your steady warmth, every small breath you take.」
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: %CHARA%
            - 「That's why... I want to run together with you. The horizon that once belonged only to me... I want to give it all to you...」
        - Terrified that another interruption would break her resolve, she poured out everything she had been holding inside in one breathless rush.
        - Gazing at Suzuka's earnest expression, her flushed cheeks, and the gentle glimmer in her wide eyes, %YOU% realized the depth of her devotion.
        - acc: 1
          content: 「So, Suzuka... does this count as a confession...?」
        - Caught completely off guard by a counter-question instead of an outright yes or no, Suzuka fell speechless once more.
        - Watching the parade of emotions flash across her face, %YOU% smiled tenderly, deciding she had been teased enough.
        - acc: 1
          content: 「The truth is, Suzuka... I've been in love with your silhouette for longer than you know.」
        - Indeed, %YOU% harbored feelings just as deep for your trainee.
        - Perhaps it had sparked on that very first predawn stroll, or perhaps in the aftermath of that accidental embrace.
        - But where it began didn't matter anymore. What mattered was that %YOU% loved Suzuka, and Suzuka loved %YOU% just as dearly.
        - %YOU% opened your arms wide with a welcoming smile.
        - Suzuka blinked, her eyes glistening with sudden tears, before throwing herself straight into %YOU%'s arms with enough force to nearly knock %YOU% flat on the pavement.
        - Burying her face deep into %YOU%'s chest, she burst into soft, hiccuping sobs.
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: %CHARA%
            - 「You dummy, %CALLNAME%... Wh-Why didn't you say so sooner... You kept teasing me all night...」
        - Suzuka gave %YOU%'s back several petulant, teary thumps.
        - %YOU% stroked %CHARA%'s silky orange locks, patiently waiting for her sobs to subside.
        - A moment later, Suzuka lifted her tear-streaked face from %YOU%'s chest.
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: %CHARA%
            - 「So... %CALLNAME%, will you always stay by my side from now on?」
        - acc: 1
          content: 「I promise. I'll always be with you, Suzuka.」
        - Hearing %YOU%'s solemn pledge, Suzuka finally smiled through her tears.
        - Then, rising on tiptoes, she pressed a soft, lingering kiss to %YOU%'s cheek.
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: %CHARA%
            - 「Thank you, %CALLNAME%... I'll see you tomorrow!」
        - Suzuka turned and bounded through the academy gates like a joyful breeze.
        - Watching her happy silhouette skip away into the dorms, %YOU% gently touched the warm spot on your cheek, a contented grin spreading across your face.
    - acc: 2
      content: 「It really is too late. Let's talk more tomorrow.」 (Keep Status Quo)
      lines:
        - Hearing %YOU%'s sensible refusal, Suzuka's expression dimmed with a pang of visible disappointment.
        - color: %COLOR%
          content:
            - fontWeight: bold
              content: %CHARA%
            - 「I understand... I'm sorry for being selfish, %CALLNAME%.」
        - Turning around quietly, she walked beside %YOU% in subdued silence all the way back to the dorms.
        - Watching her walk inside with slumped shoulders, %YOU% couldn't shake a lingering sense of melancholy.

89:
  title: A Carrot-Flavored Vow
  lines:
    - One day, %YOU% brought an exquisitely wrapped little gift box into the Trainer's office, acting deliberately secretive.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Huh? %CALLNAME%, what's that in your hands?」
    - %YOU% feigned panic, conspicuously tucking the box behind %YOU%'s back.
    - acc: 1
      content: 「Your eyes must be playing tricks on you, Suzuka. Are you sure you aren't overworked from training?」
    - Sure enough, Suzuka took the bait. %SEX% darted forward, leaning around %YOU%'s waist trying to peek at the little box.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Let me see, %CALLNAME%! Hmph, hiding it so carefully... it's not a gift from some other girl, is it?」
    - Sensing the budding jealousy in her tone, %YOU% quickly steered the conversation back to safety.
    - acc: 1
      content: 「Nothing like that at all! Finish today's workout and you'll see.」
    - Only then did Suzuka withdraw her suspicious gaze with a mild pout.
    - Wiping away a nervous bead of sweat, %YOU% prepared to kick off the day's training session.
    - divider: true
    - Practice flew by in a blur, with Suzuka executing every single drill %YOU% assigned to absolute perfection.
    - %YOU% started to offer a customary post-training debrief, but Suzuka's mind was clearly miles away, her gaze drifting toward the office.
    - Seeing her restless anticipation, %YOU% abandoned the long lecture and led her straight back into the room.
    - acc: 1
      content: 「Ta-da! Here you go, Suzuka—your reward for working so diligently today.」
    - With deliberate theatrical flair, %YOU% slid open the gift box. Beneath Suzuka's sparkling eyes sat a luscious honey carrot cake.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Wow! Thank you, %CALLNAME%! How did you know I was craving something sweet today?」
    - Seeing the delighted gleam in her eyes, %YOU% felt thoroughly pleased with %YOU%'s handiwork.
    - acc: 1
      content: 「We are 'soulmates,' after all. Go on, enjoy it while it's fresh.」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Right here? But I was hoping to take it back to the dorm...」
    - But %YOU% insistently urged her to eat it right inside the office.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Well, all right. If you say so, I'll eat it now.」
    - Murmuring softly, Suzuka obediently began savoring the little pastry.
    - %YOU% rested a chin on one hand, watching with affectionate amusement as she ate with delicate, graceful bites.
    - But as bite after bite disappeared and more than half the cake vanished without her expression shifting in the slightest, %YOU%'s anxiety began to mount.
    - Completely ignoring the growing panic in %YOU%'s eyes, Suzuka continued chewing slowly and methodically.
    - The cake wasn't very large to begin with, and before long she had polished off the entire thing.
    - Dabbing her lips with a napkin in thorough satisfaction, Suzuka completely ignored the dumbfounded look on %YOU%'s face.
    - acc: 1
      content: 「Um, Suzuka... did you just eat the whole thing? Just like that?」
    - %YOU% blurted out in utter disbelief.
    - The second the question escaped %YOU%'s lips, %YOU% realized it gave away that something had been hidden inside.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「What is it, %CALLNAME%? Is something wrong?」
    - Tilting her head in apparent confusion, she looked back at %YOU% with total innocence.
    - %YOU% shook your head vigorously in a panic.
    - (Did I somehow forget to put it in...? How could I make such a catastrophic blunder...?)
    - Watching %YOU%'s face cycle frantically through every shade of red and white, Suzuka finally couldn't hold it in any longer.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Ahahaha...! %CALLNAME%, you're so precious when you worry.」
    - Before %YOU% could process her laughter, Suzuka leaned in close, wrapping her arms around %YOU%'s neck.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Chu~」
    - Soft lips still carrying the fragrant sweetness of honey and carrot pressed against %YOU%'s, instantly scattering all troubled thoughts to the wind.
    - %YOU% instinctively tightened %YOU%'s embrace, leaning in to deepen the kiss.
    - But Suzuka parted from %YOU% with a sly flick of her tongue, expertly passing something cool and metallic into %YOU%'s mouth to conclude the kiss.
    - %SEX% pulled back just out of reach, giggling softly as she watched %YOU%'s shock reach whole new heights.
    - What Suzuka had just delivered wasn't unfamiliar at all—in fact, %YOU% had personally tucked it into that cake.
    - A diamond ring!
    - %YOU% spat it into %YOU%'s palm in a rush and wiped it clean.
    - Only then did %YOU% look up helplessly at Suzuka, who was practically glowing with triumphant laughter.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「%CALLNAME%, you really are adorable.」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「You must have secretly rehearsed what comes next dozens of times by now, right?」
    - With that, Suzuka settled herself into a proper, poised posture. Her expression grew composed, yet %YOU% could see the overwhelming thrill and eager longing burning bright behind her eyes.
    - Shaking %YOU%'s head with a fond, resigned smile, %YOU% took a deep breath, stepped forward, and dropped to one knee before Suzuka.
    - 「Suzuka, I don't know exactly when it happened, but I realized that I've fallen completely in love with you.」
    - 「Your silhouette, your smile, the sound of your voice—they're all carved permanently into my heart.」
    - 「I questioned myself over and over, wondering if this was just the natural bond between a trainer and trainee.」
    - 「Eventually, I came to realize that it wasn't mentorship at all... It was genuine love.」
    - Watching Suzuka lean forward slightly with breathless excitement, %YOU% drew in a steady breath.
    - acc: 1
      content: 「%CHARA_FULL%, will you marry me?」
    - Gazing tenderly into her eyes, %YOU% lifted the glittering ring high.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Yes! A thousand times, yes!」
    - Tears of joy welled in Suzuka's eyes, her cheeks flushing bright crimson.
    - With trembling hands, %YOU% gently lifted her equally shaking hand to slide the ring into place. But nerves got the better of %YOU%, fumbling the attempt a couple of times.
    - Looking up, %YOU% met her slightly flustered, eager gaze. After a second of mutual eye contact, both of you burst out laughing together.
    - This time, %YOU% smoothly slipped the diamond band onto the ring finger of Suzuka's left hand.
    - Standing up, %YOU% looked at her with an affection that couldn't be contained, while Suzuka's eyes overflowed with tender warmth.
    - In the next moment, %YOU% swept Suzuka up into %YOU%'s arms, spinning her in a wide circle amidst her startled, joyful squeal.
    - Holding Suzuka curled against %YOU%'s chest, feeling her squeeze %YOU% with matching strength, %YOU% grinned from ear to ear.
    - Held gently in your arms, the quiet world outside melted away. Nothing was missing; the entire universe was right here.

99:
  title: Dreams and Reality
  lines:
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Look, %CALLNAME%! That stall over there is selling banana milkshakes!」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: Walking arm in arm down the bustling street, %CHARA%'s eyes lit up as she spotted a shake stand across the avenue.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: Smiling fondly, %CALLNAME% patted %CHARA%'s soft hair, told her to wait safely on the curb, and jogged across the street.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: A few minutes later, %CALLNAME% turned back with a bright smile, holding up two cups of banana milkshake.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: Checking right to confirm the road was clear, %CALLNAME% stepped forward to jog back toward %CHARA%.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: %CHARA% glanced past %CALLNAME%'s shoulder—and froze solid in horror.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: Screeching around the corner on the wrong side of the road was a speeding, reckless car.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「%CALLNAME%, watch out—!」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content: But the desperate cry was swallowed whole by an empty void.
    - color: %COLOR%
